@startuml
' 调度主流程：创建 → filter/score → 预留事务 → 启动
' 设计依据：docs/scheduler-design.md §2.2 / §2.4.1 / §7.1 / §7.3
title 调度主流程（创建 → filter/score → 预留事务 → 启动）

actor Client
participant "GameInstanceHandler" as Handler
participant "ReconcileDispatcher" as Dispatcher
participant "Scheduler\n(ResourceAwareScheduler)" as Scheduler
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "NodeAgent" as Agent

== 创建实例 ==
Client -> Handler : POST /api/game-instances\n{game_id, game_build_id, region?, priority?, resources?}
Handler -> DB : INSERT game_instances\n(status=Stopped)
Handler --> Client : 201 Created

== 启动 ==
Client -> Handler : POST /api/game-instances/:id/start
Handler -> Dispatcher : StartGameInstance()\nstatus=Pending, RequestDispatch(instance)
activate Dispatcher
Dispatcher -> DB : UPDATE status=Pending
Dispatcher -> DB : UPDATE status=Scheduling

== 调度决策：filter → score（§2.2） ==
Dispatcher -> Scheduler : Schedule(instance)
activate Scheduler
Scheduler -> DB : 加载候选视图\n(enabled agent × node 容量/预留/占用\n× 端口占用 × game-cache 快照)
Scheduler -> Scheduler : filter 硬约束 H1-H5\n逐个节点判定并记录排除原因
alt 无候选节点
    alt 仅因资源/端口不足（可恢复 → 排队）
        Scheduler --> Dispatcher : {Outcome:Queued, Reason, Excluded[]}
        Dispatcher -> DB : status=Queued\nINSERT scheduling_queue{priority, wake_at}
        Dispatcher --> Handler : 202 已排队（原因 + 排除明细）
    else 存在结构性原因（无 cache / 区域强制不可达 / 配置错误）
        Scheduler --> Dispatcher : {Outcome:Failed, ReasonCode, Excluded[]}
        Dispatcher -> DB : status=Failed
        Dispatcher --> Handler : 调度失败（结构化原因）
    end
    note over Dispatcher : 本次调度结束；排队实例等待\nQueueWaker 唤醒或用户取消
else 有候选节点
    Scheduler -> Scheduler : score 软偏好 P1-P4\n取评分最高节点 N
end

== 预留事务（R9 防超卖，§7.1/§7.3） ==
Scheduler -> DB : BEGIN
Scheduler -> DB : SELECT nodes WHERE id=N FOR UPDATE
Scheduler -> DB : 复核 H3 allocatable / H4 端口占用
alt 复核通过
    Scheduler -> DB : UPDATE nodes SET\ncpu/mem/disk_reserved += A.request
    Scheduler -> DB : INSERT game_container_port_mappings\n(端口分配落库)
    Scheduler -> DB : UPDATE game_instances\nSET node_agent_id=N, status=PreparingBuild
    Scheduler -> DB : COMMIT
    Scheduler --> Dispatcher : {Outcome:Scheduled, NodeAgentID:N}
else 复核失败（并发被抢占）
    Scheduler -> DB : ROLLBACK（预留不生效）
    Scheduler -> Scheduler : 重试 filter/score ≤3 次
    alt 仍失败
        Scheduler --> Dispatcher : {Outcome:Queued}（转排队）
    end
end

== 实例生命周期（后续阶段） ==
Dispatcher -> Agent : PrepareGameBuild(build_id)
Agent --> Dispatcher : OperationId
Dispatcher -> Dispatcher : PollingResult 轮询（可重试/超时）
Dispatcher -> Agent : RestoringSnapshot / Starting
Agent --> Dispatcher : 运行正常
Dispatcher -> DB : status=Running
Dispatcher --> Handler : 返回连接地址（ip:port）
deactivate Scheduler
deactivate Dispatcher
@enduml
